<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $50 mln note issue.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $50 mln note issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Friday said that on June 16 it will redeem all outstanding amounts of one medium-term note issue as follows.</p>
<p>			 Interest</p>
<p>	  Principal    Rate     Maturity    Cusip</p>
<p>	$50 million    6.60     06/16/04  31364AW32</p>
<p>The redemption price of the note will be 100 percent of the principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
